			<div class="content" id="post-content-3677078">
									

<p>Written for <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-4436668">LordStonefish's 2017 Challenge</a>.</p>
<p>I deeply appreciate getting feedback from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hydrozen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2976054); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2976054&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1545343526" alt="Hydrozen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2976054)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hydrozen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2976054); return false;">Hydrozen</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/recursive" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1745049); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1745049&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1545343526" alt="ReCursive" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1745049)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/recursive" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1745049); return false;">ReCursive</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1545343526" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;">stormbreath</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1956625); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1956625&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1545343526" alt="DrChandra" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1956625)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1956625); return false;">DrChandra</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taylor-itkin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3208919); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3208919&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1545343526" alt="taylor_itkin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3208919)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taylor-itkin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3208919); return false;">taylor_itkin</a></span>, and a wee bit from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2902864); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2902864&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1545343526" alt="MaliceAforethought" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2902864)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2902864); return false;">MaliceAforethought</a></span>.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">How&nbsp;did&nbsp;this&nbsp;fucking&nbsp;thing&nbsp;even&nbsp;get&nbsp;here</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Close&nbsp;this&nbsp;damn&nbsp;collapsible&nbsp;right&nbsp;f-</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>As soon as I saw the title &quot;It's just fucking golf&quot; in the challenge thread I had the germ of an idea: a piece of anomalous garbage created by some nouveau riche asshole in a moment of pique. So I googled &quot;oldest country club in the US&quot; and started to read about <a href="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foxburg_Country_Club">Foxburg Country Club</a>. The essay on Foxburg's <a href="http://www.dot7.state.pa.us/CRGIS_Attachments/SiteResource/H079057_01H.pdf">2007 Historic Properties Nomination Form</a> mentioned HJ Crawford by name. A young hotshot oil baron who'd recently become one of the wealthiest individuals on the planet is <em>exactly</em> the sort of person to get in touch with MC&amp;D about a petty golf argument he'd had with a friend - and then try to haggle with them.</p>
<p>Trying to figure out how this thing ended up contained by the Foundation, rather than the UIU, had me spinning my gears for a moment. Then I realized Foxburg was made a historic property in <strong>2007</strong>. In real life it remained under private ownership, but as a golf-related skip I could not pass up on the comedy potential of (briefly) nationalizing it. If it weren't for stormbreath I would likely never have known about the similarities between this and 2762. A tongue in cheek crosslink that gives a site director a chance to tweak the UIU's nose is better than accidentally replicating a Series III article, right?</p>
<p>I slashed large amounts of supplementary documents late in the editing process, as the docs I added only expanded slightly on information contained in the skip itself. They described the Fox family, J. Edgar Hoover, and (in 2007) Robert Mueller all enthusiastically making this exquisitely useless object <em>somebody else's problem now.</em></p>
<p>I have some ideas for how to better expand / connect these events to other stories, but am always open to suggestions!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Edit: Added GoI tags and slightly expanded the Fox/Crawford story at the very end of the article. Hope that ties it together better.</p>

